    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"strong consensus\" feels a bit broad though. wouldn't you say a lot of the actual data is pretty messy? i've seen a lot of skeptics lately pointing out that most of those \"proven\" studies are just showing correlation, not causation. do you think the business case for DEI is actually as solid as it's being made to look?",
